 *   virtual (true | {time, animations}) default for cases, failOnPageError (true), failOnConsoleError (false),
 *   ignoreConsole [re], dir (screenshots, default out/<name>), quiet, backoff (true), cacheNet (true), browser (reuse one),
 *   out (write JSON report to this path), vp/dpr/touch defaults, contextOptions, seed (Math.random seed for every case;
